Dialogue: 3,0:22:16.73,0:22:19.86,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}绝配默契 状态飙到最高狂潮
Dialogue: 3,0:22:19.86,0:22:23.15,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}你我心有灵犀 一口气全盘亮相
Dialogue: 3,0:22:23.15,0:22:26.37,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}各路神仙狂魔  放马过来干一场如何?
Dialogue: 3,0:22:26.37,0:22:29.62,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}哪怕身处最糟绝境  也能绝地反击的猛兽小鬼
Dialogue: 3,0:22:29.62,0:22:32.74,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}足以压到一切的力量 正不断涌出 简直太酷了!
Dialogue: 3,0:22:32.74,0:22:37.54,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}再来一碗 华丽开演 笑容豪爽
Dialogue: 3,0:22:37.54,0:22:39.25,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}我们就是史·上·最·强
Dialogue: 3,0:22:39.25,0:22:41.67,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}嘿！伙伴
Dialogue: 3,0:22:41.67,0:22:42.51,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}向前进发!
Dialogue: 3,0:22:42.51,0:22:45.68,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}活力爆棚的伙伴！耶！心潮澎湃
Dialogue: 3,0:22:45.68,0:22:48.76,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}势不可挡的伙伴！耶！热血沸腾  飙得更高
Dialogue: 3,0:22:48.76,0:22:52.10,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}熊熊烈火的伙伴！耶！如火如荼
Dialogue: 3,0:22:52.10,0:22:55.44,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}战意爆表的伙伴！耶！奋发向上  同心协力
Dialogue: 3,0:22:55.44,0:22:58.40,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}属于我们的冒险篇章 突破极限 勇往直前
Dialogue: 3,0:22:58.40,0:23:00.36,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}冲啊 冲啊 冲啊
Dialogue: 3,0:23:00.36,0:23:05.03,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}紧紧拥抱只属于你我的世界
Dialogue: 3,0:23:05.03,0:23:06.99,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}燃烧吧 熊熊烈火
Dialogue: 3,0:23:06.99,0:23:08.70,OPCN,,18,0,70,发光,{\an7\fs46\blur4\bord0.6\shad0\c&H898989&\3c&H000000&\fad(240,240)}奔向未来

